    response: "Maine aapke photo aur details ke anusaar **Sajid Tax Consultant Service** ki complete, high-converting professional website taiyar kar di hai.\n\n### Summary of Updates & Added Information:\n\n- **Official Contact Details**:\n  - **Email ID**: `workwithsajid@zohomail.in` (Click-to-email integrated)\n  - **Phone Number**: `77762067134` (Click-to-call `tel:+9177762067134` aur instant WhatsApp chat link ke saath)\n  - **UPI ID**: `7762067143@ybl` (Quick Copy feature ke saath)\n\n- **Complete Office Address**:\n  - **Location**: `Office No.114A 2nd Floor Paras Juice Building Tata Road No.2 Near Prasad Chamber Opera House Mumbai-400004`\n  - **Navigation**: Direct Google Maps directions link aur One-click \"Copy Address\" button.\n\n- **Working Days & Timings**:\n  - **Monday to Saturday**: `11:00 AM \342\200\223 7:00 PM`\n  - **Sunday**: `Closed`\n  - **Live Status Badge**: Current time ke hisab se live \"Open Now\" / \"Closed\" status header aur office card me display hota hai.\n\n- **10 Core Business Services (Detail & Document Checklist)**:\n  1. **Accounting** (Day-to-day bookkeeping & financial ledgers)\n  2. **Auditing** (Statutory, Tax & Internal audits)\n  3. **Income Tax (ITR)** (Salaried, Business & Corporate filing)\n  4. **GST Registration & Filing** (GSTR-1, 3B & 9)\n  5. **PVT & LLP Registration** (MCA Company Incorporation & ROC)\n  6. **Udyam Registration** (MSME Certification & subsidies)\n  7. **Gumasta License** (Shop & Establishment Mumbai)\n  8. **TDS & TCS** (Deduction calculation & quarterly return filing)\n  9. **PF Registration** (EPFO employer compliance)\n  10. **PF Withdrawal** (Online claim filing Form 19, 10C, 31 & settlement)\n\n- **Client Convenience & Conversion Features**:\n  - **Compliance Calendar**: GST, ITR, TDS, aur PF ke statutory due dates ka live tracker taaki penalties se bacha ja sake.\n  - **Callback Request Form**: Direct inquiry form jisme client apna number aur service choose karke callback request ya direct WhatsApp message bhej sakta hai.\n  - **Floating Contact Triggers**: Mobile aur desktop par fixed Call aur WhatsApp buttons quick consultation ke liye."
