-relaxed\'> Independent Creative Strategist specializing in high-impact brand narratives and architectural design systems. </p> </div> <div class=\'flex flex-col justify-center px-20 space-y-16\'> <div> <span class=\'text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.5em] text-[#D4AF37] block mb-6\'>Contact Details</span> <div class=\'space-y-4\'> <div class=\'group\'> <div class=\'text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] opacity-40 mb-1\'>Direct Email</div> <div class=\'text-2xl font-light tracking-wide\'>workwithsajid@zohomail.in</div> </div> <div class=\'group\'> <div class=\'text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] opacity-40 mb-1\'>Mobile Connection</div> <div class=\'text-2xl font-light tracking-wide\'>77762067134</div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <span class=\'text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.5em] text-[#D4AF37] block mb-6\'>Location & Scheduling</span> <div class=\'grid grid-cols-2 gap-8\'> <div> <div class=\'text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] opacity-40 mb-1\'>Studio Address</div> <div class=\'text-sm leading-relaxed opacity-80\'> 402 Elite Plaza,<br> Business District,<br> Mumbai, MH 400051 </div> </div> <div> <div class=\'text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] opacity-40 mb-1\'>Availability</div> <div class=\'text-sm leading-relaxed opacity-80\'> Monday \342\200\224 Friday<br> 10:00 AM \342\200\224 06:00 PM<br> GMT +5:30 </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </main> <footer class=\'px-12 py-8 flex justify-between items-center border-t border-[#ffffff10] bg-[#0D0D0D]\'> <div class=\'text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] opacity-30\'> \302\251 MMXXIV All Rights Reserved </div> <div class=\'flex gap-4 items-center\'> <div class=\'w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#D4AF37]\'></div> <span class=\'text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] opacity-60\'>Active for Engagements</span> </div> <div class=\'text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] opacity-30\'> Verified Profile </div> </footer> </div>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
